  "format": "AmiWind recorded stage pin 1",
  "exception": "BUILD-SEYDA-REGEN-30",
  "decision": "Owner decisions, 8 October 2026: v0.0.31 and v0.0.32 ship the recorded v0.0.31 Seyda Neen maps byte for byte; seyda.bsp ships as the fallback region alias (option A); the world streamer (v0.0.33) rebuilds Seyda Neen.",
  "source": "AmiWind v0.0.31 image, boot partition, id1/ (the owner's own copy; never shipped with the source)",
  "aliases": {
    "maps/seyda.bsp": {
      "source": "maps/sn029.bsp",
      "reason": "Owner decision (option A), 8 October 2026: seyda.bsp is the fallback region alias (sn029), as the builder's own Seyda region conversion writes it. v0.0.31's complete-town seyda.bsp is not shipped: the v0.0.32 release actor gate refuses its seven actor copies, while the recorded region maps pass. dbg tp seydaneen and region streaming use the region directory and are unchanged."
    }
  },
